flowchart TD
    START([Request arrives]) --> INPUT{JSON object with non-empty request <= 4000 chars?}
    INPUT -->|No| BAD[400; no agent execution]
    INPUT -->|Yes| SAVE[Commit request record as processing]
    SAVE -->|Storage error| STOREERR[503; classifier and workflow not called]
    SAVE --> CLASS[Closed-set classification]
    CLASS --> CCHK{Classification structure passes checker?}
    CCHK -->|Retryable and fewer than 2 attempts| RETRY[Record checker feedback]
    RETRY --> CLASS
    CCHK -->|Exhausted or invalid| REVIEW[Set pending_review; no workflow]
    CCHK -->|Yes| VALID[Validate category, confidence, and review decision]
    VALID --> VCHK{Validation and checker approve automatic path?}
    VCHK -->|No| REVIEW
    VCHK -->|Yes| ROUTE[Select configured category workflow]
    ROUTE --> RCHK{Selected route equals canonical configured route?}
    RCHK -->|No| FAILED[Record failure; no execution]
    RCHK -->|Yes| EXEC[Resolve workflow in local registry]
    EXEC --> EXCHK{Structured execution result valid?}
    EXCHK -->|No or exception| FAILED
    EXCHK -->|Yes| DONE[Persist completed result and actual trace]
    REVIEW --> HUMAN{Human review action}
    HUMAN -->|Approve known supported category with canonical route| APPROVE[Re-check route, then tracked execution]
    HUMAN -->|Reject| REJECT[Persist rejected state]
    HUMAN -->|Clarify| CLARIFY[Persist awaiting_clarification state]
    APPROVE --> DONE
    BAD --> END([Return])
    STOREERR --> END
    FAILED --> END
    DONE --> END
    REJECT --> END
    CLARIFY --> END
